		v1.0.13 (2026-07-21) — 硬件调试新增 [HardwareUI] 自定义设备路由扩展点

		[新增]
		- PF.Core 1.0.7→1.0.8：新增 HardwareUIAttribute，与 CommunicationUIAttribute/StationUIAttribute
